<title>USA: PanEnergy Corp sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>PanEnergy Corp sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanEnergy Corp said on Friday that its board has declared a special dividend of $0.0064 per share to cover state transfer taxes associated with its pending merger with Duke Power Co.</p>
<p>The dividend, based on 151.5 million shares outstanding as of May 31, will be paid June 18 to shareholders of record on June 17, the company said.</p>
<p>Under the merger, each share of PanEnergy will be converted into the right to receive 1.044 shares of Duke Power stock, PanEnergy said.</p>
</text>
